A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Exile and Return, first mentioned at 1Ch.9.12; 
son of: Malchijah (H4441H); 
father of: Zechariah (H2148X)
§ Pashur = "freedom"
1) a priest, son of Malchiah and one of the chief princes in the reign of king Zedekiah of Judah
2) a priest, son of Immer, chief governor of the temple, and the one who struck and then put the prophet Jeremiah into the stocks in the reign of…

